    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udece\ufe0f <strong>Welcome to the Hotel Wars of the Bustling City!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the rising star of a brand-new hotel brand. In a city where competition is fierce and urban chaos reigns, can you turn a humble plot of land into the next viral destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and expand strategically across a grid-based city. Every choice \u2014 from your clientele to your facilities \u2014 shapes your hotel's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you cater to elite business travelers?<br>Or become a dreamy haven for vacationers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room, every amenity, and every staff member contributes to your hotel\u2019s strength. Choose wisely!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Modular Building System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835960/extras/4b2c636eb965d194b0e8e0306223d79d.poster.avif?t=1753436774\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835960/extras/4b2c636eb965d194b0e8e0306223d79d.webm?t=1753436774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835960/extras/4b2c636eb965d194b0e8e0306223d79d.mp4?t=1753436774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835960/extras/8be2767b864f6dd46acb508381a1b07e.avif?t=1753436774\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Customers \u00d7 Events \u00d7 City News</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: