t\u2019s about outplaying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Membership &amp; Loyalty System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835960/extras/e5be4bb555aaf449b14293cfc82b4a3c.poster.avif?t=1753436774\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835960/extras/e5be4bb555aaf449b14293cfc82b4a3c.webm?t=1753436774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835960/extras/e5be4bb555aaf449b14293cfc82b4a3c.mp4?t=1753436774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835960/extras/1f2db3546bfb0506be863fd2da066919.avif?t=1753436774\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcca <strong>Every Decision Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise room prices and squeeze out profits?<br>Or run promotions and attract a flood of foot traffic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835960/extras/8656b277a0f684816290857632932801.avif?t=1753436774\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>",
